{#- One header for the whole site. It used to exist in eight hand-maintained
    variants across three technologies, which is the economic reason the site
    stopped at six URLs: every new page meant another copy to keep in sync.

    Subpages pass `subpage: true` and get the frosted state plus the same
    navigation — before this, /work/ and /lab/ had no site nav at all, so a
    visitor who reached them could only go home or to the contact form. -#}
  <header class="header{% if subpage %} scrolled subpage__header{% endif %}" id="header">
    <div class="header__inner">
      <a href="/" class="header__logo" aria-label="CREATIVE MK Home">
        <span class="header__logo-mark">CREATIVE<span class="header__logo-mk">mk</span></span>
      </a>
      {#- Wayfinding (immersive-plan §12): the underline slides to the link
          whose section is on screen — one indicator, moved by js/daylight.js.
          The dropdown stops being furniture: each item opens its own
          accordion row via data-cap-index, or jumps to its real section. -#}
      <nav class="header__nav" id="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/work/" class="header__nav-link" data-nav-section="work"{% if page.url == "/work/" %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-i18n="nav.work">Work</a>
        <div class="header__dropdown">
          <button class="header__dropdown-trigger" data-nav-section="capabilities" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="services-menu">
            <span data-i18n="nav.services">Services</span>
            <svg class="header__dropdown-icon" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2 4l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
          </button>
          {#- Was: seven links, five of which resolved to the SAME anchor
              (#capabilities) and merely opened an accordion row. Now each one
              is its own page. This is the mechanism the owner named when he
              said the site felt like a single landing page. -#}
          <div class="header__dropdown-menu">
            {%- for service in services %}
            <a href="/services/{{ service.slug }}/" class="header__dropdown-item">{{ service.en.title }}</a>
            {%- endfor %}
            <a href="/services/" class="header__dropdown-item" data-i18n="nav.allServices">All Capabilities</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/lab/" class="header__nav-link" data-nav-section="lab"{% if page.url == "/lab/" %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-i18n="nav.lab">Lab</a>
        <a href="/studio/" class="header__nav-link" data-nav-section="about"{% if page.url == "/studio/" %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-i18n="nav.about">About</a>
        <a href="/insights/" class="header__nav-link" data-nav-section="news"{% if "/insights/" in page.url %} aria-current="page"{% endif %} data-i18n="nav.blog">Insights</a>
        <span class="header__nav-underline" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </nav>
      <div class="header__right">
        <button class="sound-toggle" id="sound-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Ambient sound / Sonido ambiental">
          <span class="sound-toggle__bar"></span><span class="sound-toggle__bar"></span><span class="sound-toggle__bar"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="lang-switch" id="lang-switch">
          <button class="lang-switch__btn active" data-lang="en" aria-label="Switch to English">EN</button>
          <button class="lang-switch__btn" data-lang="es" aria-label="Cambiar a Espa&ntilde;ol">ES</button>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact.html" class="header__contact-btn" data-i18n="nav.contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <button class="header__menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="header__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <nav class="header__mobile-nav" id="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
      <a href="/work/" class="header__mobile-nav-link" data-i18n="nav.work">Work</a>
      <a href="/lab/" class="header__mobile-nav-link" data-i18n="nav.lab">Lab</a>
      <a href="/services/" class="header__mobile-nav-link" data-i18n="nav.services">Services</a>
      <a href="/studio/" class="header__mobile-nav-link" data-i18n="nav.about">About</a>
      <a href="/insights/" class="header__mobile-nav-link" data-i18n="nav.blog">Insights</a>
      <a href="/contact.html" class="header__mobile-nav-link" data-i18n="nav.contact">Contact</a>
      <div class="lang-switch" style="margin-top:auto;">
        <button class="lang-switch__btn active" data-lang="en" aria-label="Switch to English">EN</button>
        <button class="lang-switch__btn" data-lang="es" aria-label="Cambiar a Espa&ntilde;ol">ES</button>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>
